去電反應，女服務生要我回去拿。\n走路13分鐘的路程回到了店裡，我告訴女服務生要拿胡麻醬，女服務生轉頭跟另一位男服務生說：拿一包胡麻醬給她。\n男服務生遞來胡麻醬包和海苔絲包……全程服務生沒有一句不好意思或對不起！\n因為妳的疏忽，我來回路程26分鐘拿醬包，還有一開始的點錯餐算錯錢，我都能體諒妳可能太忙而有疏漏，但妳的態度讓我感到不舒服！",null,[0,121]]]],[null,1783266474000000,1783266474000000,"1 個月前",["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003d5@1:CAEQrcz1_gkiGwoZQ0hfTno5Uk9wbmg4QjBFdl9aSHlrRTNmUQ%7CCAEQrcz1_gkiMAoZQ0hfTno5Uk9wbmg4QjBFdl9aSHlrRTNmURoTQ2d3SXF2bXAwZ1lRMVA3dy1nRQ\u0026t\u003d7\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,null,"0ahUKEwiHhcCMs9eWAxVxlq8BHTENJKgQ_2MITSgC"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/2874671841874029397/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjA0TVdORVJsaGpWMmQ2VGxWMFYyUjVNSHBNVm1SVldXeEJkMlZHUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/2874671841874029397/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjA0TVdORVJsaGpWMmQ2VGxWMFYyUjVNSHBNVm1SVldXeEJkMlZHUlJBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/2874671841874029397/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjA0TVdORVJsaGpWMmQ2VGxWMFYyUjVNSHBNVm1SVldXeEJkMlZHUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/2874671841874029397/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjA0TVdORVJsaGpWMmQ2VGxWMFYyUjVNSHBNVm1SVldXeEJkMlZHUlJBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/2874671841874029397/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjA0TVdORVJsaGpWMmQ2VGxWMFYyUjVNSHBNVm1SVldXeEJkMlZHUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/2874671841874029397/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjA0TVdORVJsaGpWMmQ2VGxWMFYyUjVNSHBNVm1SVldXeEJkMlZHUlJBQhAA"],null,["zh-Hant"],[["抱歉抱歉 我是老闆娘\n第一時間看到您的留言\n馬上詢問今天晚上的員工發生什麼事 並訓斥了他（她）們一頓 並再群組佈達 告誡所有員工\n讓您多跑了一趟真過意不去\n下次來看我時 跟我告知一下\n再讓我好好補償您 再給我們一次服務的機會 真的是對不起～\n",null,[0,64]]]],[null,null,1114,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT204MWNERlhjV2d6TlV0V2R5MHpMVmRVWWxBd2VGRR